om2
note snap: the forced next item of an Omega program (words that click)
note stdin: word table lines "NAME ARITY ISTYPE", a line "%%", a mode line (strip, expand or count), then the program
note strip: stdout is the strand, the program without the items that had no alternative (exit 3 and no stdout when the program is outside the model)
note expand: stdout is the program, every forced item put back
note count: no stdout
note every mode: stderr "snap items N forced F bad B"
note sound by design: when anything about a line is not known for certain, the rest of that line is open and nothing is forced
