put fof k off
put fln k n
put far k ar
sv S_NF add k 1
end
fn findfn off ulong n ulong to ulong
note parameter count + 1 of the newest function of that name, 0 when absent
nf = g S_NF
for i ulong nf bound 9223372036854775807
j = sub sub nf 1 i
if weq get fof j get fln j off n
ret add get far j 1
end
end
ret 0
end
fn pushblk kind ulong to void
k = g S_NB
if ge k len bkk
m = add mul k 2 64
